# OpenTelemetry and integrations

Use OpenTelemetry when your framework already emits standard spans or when you want a vendor-neutral exporter path.

```bash
pip install opentelemetry-sdk opentelemetry-exporter-otlp-proto-http
```

Send OTLP HTTP JSON to `https://uncoil.dev/api/otel` with the project API key. Framework instrumentation can add model, token, retrieval, embedding, and tool attributes; include session and deployment attributes when you need grouping in the dashboard.
